      "source": "Creates a <a href=\"RevisionSort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>RevisionSort</code></a> with ascending order for the revision number property, i.e. more recent revisions\nwill come last.",
      "translation": "创建一个<a href=\"RevisionSort.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.history 中的类\"><code>RevisionSort</code></a>，按修订号属性升序排列，即较新的修订将排在最后。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a <a href=\"RevisionSort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>RevisionSort</code></a> with descending order for the revision number property, i.e. more recent revisions\nwill come first.",
      "translation": "创建一个<a href=\"RevisionSort.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.history 中的类\"><code>RevisionSort</code></a>，按修订号属性降序排列，即最近的修订将排在前面。",
      "count": 3
