    {
      "source": "Returns in which direction to sort revisions for the given <a href=\"../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> instance. Defaults to\n<a href=\"../domain/Sort.Direction.html#ASC\"><code>Sort.Direction.ASC</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a href=\"../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 实例的修订版排序方向。默认值为 <a href=\"../domain/Sort.Direction.html#ASC\"><code>Sort.Direction.ASC</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A dedicated <a href=\"../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> implementation that allows the definition of the ordering of revisions independently of the\nproperty name the revision number is held in.",
      "translation": "一个专用的<a href=\"../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>实现，它允许独立于存储修订号的属性名称来定义修订的排序顺序。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
